2.35,0:00:46.48,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll get through it Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.63,0:00:47.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,alwaysDialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:51.55,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:54.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:57.09,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Even though there are tearsDialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:01:00.56,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we don't want anyone to seeDialogue: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:03.45,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:06.46,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the compass that leads to our dreams Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.57,0:01:09.19,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,always points straight ahead Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.19,0:01:11.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We can't stop hereDialogue: 0,0:01:18.79,0:01:21.45,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get running,Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.75,0:01:24.50,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,head past everyone elseDialogue: 0,0:01:24.59,0:01:27.08,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,So long as we don't run from it,Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.18,0:01:30.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we can take hold of tomorrow Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:33.55,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.64,0:01:36.47,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,everything we see in the moment,Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:38.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we should record it all Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:41.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,in the blank slates of our minds Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.06,0:01:55.38,Title,,0,0,250,,MonsterDialogue: 0,0:02:03.88,0:02:13.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Showing mercy is unbecoming of a raging lion! Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.18,0:02:14.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.10,0:02:19.78,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Taking the second rumble ball is like gambling.Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:22.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,There are seven transformations in total.Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.56,0:02:27.66,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, the probability of getting Arm Point is one in seven.Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:33.67,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,If I could get it, I could hammer my strongest attack into him.Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.15,0:02:37.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's my only chance!Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:39.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arm Point!Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shishi Kebab!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.61,0:02:50.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For my friends...Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:52.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arm Point!Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.36,0:02:55.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arm Point!Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.30,0:03:00.63,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Wrong one!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:03.20,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Wrong one! Why doesn't it come out?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:06.87,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,My body is at the end of its rope. I somehow have to get Arm Point out!Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:10.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:13.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.47,0:03:15.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's out! I didn't notice it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:17.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be prepared!Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:19.13,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll put everything I have...Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.13,0:03:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,into this attack!Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:23.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cloven...Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.11,0:03:25.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shishi Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.39,0:03:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I back off now, I won't get another chance!Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cloven...Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:40.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body: Adamantine! Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:43.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roseo Blizzard!Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:49.87,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Go down!Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:53.83,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That was my best attack!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.54,0:03:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh...Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:07.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh... splendid...!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:14.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was indeed a beautiful blizzard of... cherry blossom petals.Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:18.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't...Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.11,0:04:22.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't...Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.44,0:04:25.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did I do it?Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:35.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't bear it anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:39.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will give you hell!Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:47.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick: Lotus!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:55.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it. I no longer have the energy to fight back. Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:58.11,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:02.82,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Chopper, what in the world did you do?Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:06.28,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I don't remember.Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:13.11,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,"I don't remember" doesn't cut it.Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.11,0:05:17.08,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,It was good that no one died, at least.Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:19.87,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Even while you were sleeping,Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.87,0:05:22.75,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,the entire country was making a big fuss about that night.Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:25.38,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,How are we going to settle that?Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:28.09,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,So I did something that terrible?Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.09,0:05:30.77,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,You almost destroyed an entire village.Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.77,0:05:33.92,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,It's fine that you love experiments, just like your old man did,Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:38.06,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,but you have to account for all possible outcomes when conducting them. Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:42.02,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,All possible outcomes? Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.48,0:05:46.15,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Good grief. You even stir up trouble like him. Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:49.65,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Doctorine.Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.65,0:05:51.32,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I won't do it again.Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:54.79,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I'll never do it again, so please don't kick me out.Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:06:00.29,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,You're such a fool. Hurry up and get better.Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.29,0:06:01.95,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I can't even go shopping. Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:08.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vital Response!Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:10.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hair Bind!Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:18.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't cry. Don't cry.Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:22.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you do, it'll be a disgrace to your manhood.Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:23.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill me. Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:29.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't an evening in a mountain village where you can hear the cicadas.Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.73,0:06:37.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a journey to hell's furnace that you knew could come. Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The leaves I took from a willow tree to give to you as a parting gift, Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.14,0:06:44.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hoping for your return someday, are colored crimson!Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:48.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take it! Now, now, now, now!Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.83,0:06:54.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crimson... Song of the Willow!Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:06:57.43,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die.Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:04.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin! That's right. I can't give up!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.17,0:07:10.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He slipped away from my Hair Bind!Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:11.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rumble!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:18.95,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,If I'm gonna die anyway, I'll do it!Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:23.63,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Just please, nobody come into this room.Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:29.59,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I used three rumble balls.Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:34.55,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Then I lost consciousness and after that...Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:39.06,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,You could say that your devil fruit powers went out of control.Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:43.52,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Don't ever go down that path again, okay?Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:49.49,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,It's too much power. It destroys foes, friends, and even your own body. Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:52.21,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What you turned into was just like a real...Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.78,0:07:58.82,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,monster.Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:10.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm super this week, and yet I still had a harder time than I thought.Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, well...Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.52,0:08:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got his key.Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:30.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. 4.Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.44,0:08:35.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The key the swordsman and the nose wanted was No. 2, right? Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.85,0:08:37.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This guy had No. 4.Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That guy had No. 3.Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:41.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And there's only one left.Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:45.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The one with the No. 2 key is that secretary woman! Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.26,0:08:48.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd better hurry up.Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:50.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll go help them out!Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.54,0:09:16.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys don't have much time, right?Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:19.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought you weren't going to go easy on me.Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:22.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did I hear you wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:25.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you mock me?! I won't let you get away with it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:28.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, bring it on.Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.08,0:09:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to wait. The battle has already started, you know.Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:38.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that an ability user would take a bath in front of her enemy. Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.97,0:09:42.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If your body is halfway submerged, you shouldn't have full use of your powers.Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:47.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that I'm leaving myself wide open?Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:53.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about it,Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because just like me, you can't exert your strength, either.Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:58.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pardon me for a bit.Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you do to me?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:17.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't solving a mystery like that one of the true joys of fighting an ability user?Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.43,0:10:28.10,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It was definitely this woman who put Sanji-kun in that state.Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:32.73,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to be careful. Or there's no point in me taking his place to fight.Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:38.65,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,The strength I lost is coming back little by little. Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the power of the Perfect Clima-Tact!Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:52.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're mistaken if you think I'm just a dainty beauty! Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.91,0:10:57.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can move my legs, too!Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:04.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here I come!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:07.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder Charge!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.63,0:11:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Swing Arm!Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's an amazing weapon.Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.61,0:11:33.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These are...Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.15,0:11:35.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,clouds?Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.79,0:11:38.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd just lay on the floor doing nothing, is there?Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.01,0:11:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunderbolt... Tempo!Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:11:59.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's your own fault for acting so confident.Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:22.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was a surprise.Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.29,0:12:25.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd be hit by lightning indoors.Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:31.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that thing that guarded you from the lightning?Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.03,0:12:33.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It turned into bubbles and disappeared.Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.15,0:12:36.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have no chance against me unless you solve that mystery.Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.41,0:12:40.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you can do it.Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.53,0:12:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was as if soap turned into bubbles.Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:46.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You could be a soap human with Bubble Bubble Fruit powers. Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:48.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's something like that.Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:53.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-But even if, for example, you figured out what kind of powers they are,Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's not like you have a chance to win! How insolent!Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.13,0:13:00.00,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,So that was right on the mark. Now I kinda feel guilty.Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:04.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right. My specialty is cleanliness. Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:07.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ate the Bubble Bubble Fruit...Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.07,0:13:09.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and became a soap human whose entire body lathers.Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't it wonderful?Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! How sexy! To be honest, I'd be happy to have a secretary like her.Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:20.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! What am I, a middle-aged guy?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:25.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But isn't that ineffective for fighting? It doesn't look very strong. Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:31.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I can freely manipulate the bubbles that come out of my body.Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:36.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.19,0:13:37.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll show you.Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:40.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bubbles from the bathtub are...!Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:42.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bubble Master:Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.74,0:13:44.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soap Sheep!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:49.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.29,0:13:52.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's this? Isn't it wonderful?Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:56.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're an idiot, aren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:13:59.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be deceived by my appearance.Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.27,0:14:00.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:03.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sheep Cloud: Relaxing Bubbles! Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:09.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You lost your strength at the room's entrance. Why was that? Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.19,0:14:11.25,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:14.09,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That must've been her powers, too.Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.09,0:14:15.21,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bubbles!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.21,0:14:18.23,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, when I stepped into this room, Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:23.84,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,there were bubbles all over the floor!Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:27.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.68,0:14:35.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You noticed it too late.Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.39,0:14:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My strength is fading away. Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.31,0:14:44.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This happened earlier, too, because I stepped on the bubbles on the floor.Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.60,0:14:49.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll learn the horror of this power little by little.Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.87,0:15:04.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bubbles from my body scrub away all sorts of things. Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.78,0:15:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They naturally handle filth and spots, but they also sap your strength, among other things. Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:16.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I don't want you to forget that I'm an assassin from a secret organization.Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:22.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can move my body! Her kicking me made the bubbles go away!Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:25.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna take this anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:27.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.04,0:15:31.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That weapon's power alone...Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.37,0:15:33.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is still an unknown quantity to me.Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.58,0:15:39.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Golden Bubbles!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.75,0:15:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.33,0:15:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stand!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:53.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! What's wrong with my legs?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.80,0:15:58.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty, aren't they?Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:16:03.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything I touch gains a beautiful gloss.Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:06.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make your skin shiny...Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.93,0:16:09.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every inch of your body.Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:24.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A man... A man...Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:33.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A man has battles that he must face head-on!Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.43,0:16:34.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:37.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick: Lotus!Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.59,0:16:42.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Song of the Willow!Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:33.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.42,0:18:00.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's coming next,Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:02.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I'm gonna go ahead and replenish my cola first.Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I wonder how that deer's doing.Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:12.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell...Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.37,0:18:27.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:36.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the CP9 guy who was in the fridge!Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:39.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Did this monster bring him down?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.39,0:18:50.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.51,0:19:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel like that deer was wearing the same kind of hat. Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.46,0:19:04.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! You're not that deer-gorilla, are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.81,0:19:21.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! This can't be happening! Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.74,0:19:24.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake.Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.25,0:19:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kumadori-san!Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:30.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He flew from the Tower of Justice?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:33.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be! Who on earth could...? Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.11,0:19:39.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good grief! What the hell is he?! Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:54.58,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,A voice? Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.12,0:20:00.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.18,0:20:01.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:05.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you stopping, Nico Robin?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening, Ms. My-existence-is-a-crime?! Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.58,0:20:13.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lucci! Drag her along!Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.03,0:20:15.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grab her by her hair!Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:20.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an order.Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.44,0:20:23.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get moving, Nico Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.03,0:20:33.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me, you still think that the Straw Hats are coming to your rescue? Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.66,0:20:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How stupid!Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.12,0:20:41.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you seriously still laying your hopes on such weak pirates?Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.45,0:20:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That explosion earlier was surely just our imagination.Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.80,0:20:47.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way that they can come here!Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.18,0:20:53.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While you're enjoying your little dream, we'll pass through the Gates of Justice.Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.72,0:20:58.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Bridge of Hesitation looms in front of the Gates of Justice. Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.25,0:21:01.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll cross the first half of the bridge, which is now up. Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:05.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When the gates are opened, the other half will rise from the sea,Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.97,0:21:08.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and we'll finally go through the Gates of Justice.Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.49,0:21:12.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once the gates are closed again,Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.41,0:21:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'll never have the feeling of hope...Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:20.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ever again.Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.45,0:21:25.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The only feeling you'll have is a sense of guilt.Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.05,0:21:30.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll endlessly atone for your sin of having lived until today.Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.85,0:21:33.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, Nico Robin?Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:50.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, let's hurry.Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:52.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on already!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.93,0:22:05.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.45,0:22:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What was that?! I just heard a voice!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:18.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! What was that voice?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.52,0:22:26.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief, please take Nico Robin and hurry on ahead.Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:30.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? Doors?Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.86,0:22:34.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They don't look like iron this time.Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.64,0:22:49.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? This room is bigger. Where am I? Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.77,0:22:54.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you are! Pigeon guy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.43,0:22:59.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you came.Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.43,0:23:00.60,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000, KaitouYahiko  Quality Control: danpmss, DolphinWeabu, Honoka, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 2,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 2,0:00:00.38,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 2,0:00:00.42,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0